<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Ngindo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Akaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja Paulo kwa Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Akae</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akaefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua kwa Akaefeso jiandikigwa kingobu chimwe na balua ja Akakolosai chaka cha 60 kuboka pukubelekwa Kilisto. Nhwandiki akilenga mwene kutenda nga ndundame Paulo (Lipungu lya 1:1). Akachomi ajingi bajekatile kutenda Paulo baandakila Akaefeso iganukube yalamu yakwe ibonakineje mwenio nambu ibonekana mubalua ja Akakolosai. Magambu genia ngipaligwa jitindile mumakanicha goa ga nkoa gwenio. Uyo Paulo alengite ajiandika balua jenie pakiba mukipungo (Lipungu lya 3:1, 4:1, na 6:20). Paulo ngampeleke balua Tikiko ku nhwalo gwa mwanja gwakwe gukutyangi kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto buku Efeso (Lipungu lya 6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso, ikiba kilambo kikolongwa na boma jutawala gwa Loma munkoa gwa Asia njoko. Ku Efeso ikiba kilambo chikimanyakine muno kitembe nnoongo munkege ojwakemigwa Atemi jwa Akagiliki (Itendwa 19:23-31). Kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto buku Efeso ngabatumbu kwa makakala, kuboka penia ngababe banga makakala gambu gukotoka kumpala Kilisto andi pukutumbula (Kuekuligwa 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo nusu ja balua jakwe alanduli Nnoongo pabapambwi bandu bakwe na kakombola angweto kuboke mumabaja gabe kupete Yesu Kilisto. Ngabeka kilandanakio kati ja kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto na mmele, na Kilisto nga mutwe gwa mmele gwenio na alandanaki nyumba na Kilisto kube liganga likolongwa li pikimbetule lya nyumba jenie. Mu nusu jakwe ja pili jikitabu Paulo abekite ulongoi pipaligwa kutama kwa bandu abunhwamini Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akilenga mwene na kapata abali bandu buku Efeso (Lipungu lya 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Alanduli pikibi kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto pabalondigwe na Kilisto (Lipungu lya 1:3-3:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe Paulo aandike pabapaligwa kutama bandu abunhwamini Kilisto (Lipungu lya 4:1-6:20).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ajomole balua jakwe kwa kalumbi kindimba (Lipungu lya 6:21-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ne nana Paulo, nandundame ba Yesu Kilisto kwa mapalano ga Nnoongo. Nunhwandikila mangweto mabandu ba Nnoongo kwenio ku Efeso, manhwaminike mu kulondana na Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nannyopelanga upeele na tengela kuboka ku Nnoongo Awawa bito na kwa Nngwana Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="s">Kindimba kuboka kwa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akoliigwe Nnoongo Awawa ba Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto! Magambu, mu kulondana kwito na Kilisto kukutupe indimba yoa eiboka kumbengu kupete Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tango nu kupanganiaje dunia, Nnoongo ngatupambula tube bakwe mu kulondana na Kilisto kupala tube chwapi na tanga malemwa nnongi jakwe. Kwa magambu ga mapalano gabe, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngatupambu nu kupangania kutumbu lolo kutubeka tube ingota yakwe mwene kwa ndela ja Yesu Kilisto. Kwa laa jakwe nu kupala kwakwe mwene. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yene tunnumbe Nnoongo magambu ga gwambone gwakwe gukuomongwa gambu atupile Mwana jwakwe jwampala abe hupo yangalepa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gambu kwa myai jakwe Kilisto Nnoongo atukombwile, yani mabaja gito galekekeigwe. Yene gwambone nkolongwa gwa Nnoongo, <verse number="8" style="v"/>atupi ndu muno! Magambu ga malango nu kumanya kwakwe kwoa, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nnoongo ngakamwa chache chakipai mwene, ngatubeka tumanye nhwalo gwakwe ogugukiite, gwenio ukiba ubekigwe kubegelela ku ndela ja Kilisto. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nhwalo gwenio kabi aulenganakie kukingobu chabekite mwene, kongola ipanganigwa yoa pamwe, ilebe yukumbengu na padunia, kubeka mukinala cha Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mu kulondana na Kilisto, twenga atuchagwi kube bandu bakwe andi papai Nnoongo, alenganakia kila kilebe kukupala kwakwe mwene kutumbu lolo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Twenga tatulongalile kunhwamini Kilisto tupaligwa kukilumbalila kibumo cha Nnoongo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Namangweto uyo mmi mabandu ba Nnoongo, pumujoa nhwalo gwa kweli yani Nhwalo Gwambone ogunnetila ukomboi, mangweto uyo ngumunhwamini Kilisto, Nnoongo kukulaya kutenda mangweto nga bakwe, ngammekanga muuli gwakwe kukumpeganga Uhuke jwa Chwapi ojwatulagila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Uhuke jwa Chwapi jwenio nga poni kulaya kutenda matupokela chache chatulagile Nnoongo agabalagila bandu bakwe, ilebe yene itulenge kweli kube Nnoongo mabakombolanga boa ababi bakwe. Tukilumbalile kibumo chakwe!</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo annumba Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwa magambu genia, kuboke apanajoa imani jinu kwa Nngwana Yesu na mapalano ginu kwa bandu ba Nnoongo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>ngotwikije ngu kunnumba Nnoongo kwa magambu ginu. Nankombakelanga mu kugongalela kwango, <verse number="17" style="v"/>kupala Nnoongo jwa Nngwana gwito Yesu Kilisto, Awawa bina kibumo, bampegange Uhuke jwabe ojwapakumpe mme na malango nu kunhweku Nnoongo kupala mummanye. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nannyopa Nnoongo ajieku myojo jinu jioto kulola lumuli lwakwe, nhwoto kulimanya lihyobalelo elyankemile nu kumanya kibumo nduu chi kindimba chabalagi kape bandu ba Nnoongo, <verse number="19" style="v"/>nu kumanya uwecho gwakwe nkolongwa muno kwa magambu gito twenga tatuamini. Uwecho gukamu liengo nkati jito nga tela na makakala makolongwa muno, <verse number="20" style="v"/>makakala ganga ngu ugaga agunhyoya Kilisto kuboka kwa abawile, ngantamika kingonu chakwe cha kalelo chu kumbengu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwenio, Kilisto atawala kila kinala, makakala ni kingwana, liina lyakwe likolongwa ku dunia jenje na ejipakuika. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nnoongo abekite ilebe yoa mumaboko gakwe, nu kumpambula Kilisto jwatawala kila kilebe, abe mutwe ku bandu boa abunhwamini Kilisto, <verse number="23" style="v"/>benia nga mmele gwa Kilisto, mmele gwenio gunnimbia Kilisto na Kilisto nga ojwalenganikia ilebe yoa kila paali.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuboka mukiu nu kujingi mubwomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe makiba nhwilangite muhuke gambu ga malemwa na mabaja ginu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kingobu chache matamanga kengama ndela mbaja ja nnema gongo, makannyali ntawala ju michepela juna makakala gu kunani kamaunde, jwenio ojwabatawala bandu ngoe banga nnyali Nnoongo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na twe tuboa takiba andi benia, ngututama ukengama tama jito mbaja ja mmele ja dunia nu ukamwa ile eipala mibele jito na malango gito. Twenga uyo tatama andi angweto, tukapaligwa kupata hukumu ja Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nambu Nnoongo juna kia muno. Ngatupala kwa mapalano makolongwa, <verse number="5" style="v"/>iganukube takiba tuwile mukihuke kwa magambu ga mabaja, ngatutenda kube tammomi pamwe na Kilisto. Gwambone nkolongwa gwa Nnoongo mangweto nkoligwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mukube pamwe na Yesu Kilisto, Nnoongo ngatuyoya pamwe na jwenio, ngatubeka tutame pamwe nakwe kumbengu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Atenda genia kupala kulaya ku ibelei yoa ipakuika gwambone gwakwe nkolongwa gukuomongwa gwenio aulaite kwito mukulondana kwito na Kilisto Yesu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Magambu, kwa gwambone gwa Nnoongo nkomboligwe kwa ndela ja imani. Kile chenie ngiti magambu ga kachana kwinuje, nambu hupo ya Nnoongo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ngiti kiboke muitendwa yinuje, mundu akalokelokeje kilebe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nnoongo atutei andi putubile, kukulondana na Kilisto Yesu, Nnoongo ngatupangana kupala tutame ku itendwa yambone eyatupanganakia tutende.</para>
  <para style="s">Kube pamwe mu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkombakelange pamakiba kalakala mangweto mammi mabandu banga Akayahudi mankemigwa, mangainigwa, na Akayahudi, abikikema, abainigwe, kwa magambu ga chache chibatendanga mumibele jabe kwa maboko kulaya kutenda nga bandu ba Nnoongo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kalakala mangweto matamanga panga Kilisto, makiba panja ja lungolo lwa Isilaeli, makiba makamageni na makibangaje na paali papoa mu lilagano elyalagila Nnoongo. Makibanga panga lihyobalelo andi bandu bangammanya Nnoongo pannema pano. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu ngoe, ku kulondana na Yesu Kilisto, mangwetu mamakibanga kutaali kalakala, mmekigwe papipi na Nnoongo pokaligwe ku ndela ja myai ja Kilisto. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Gambu Kilisto mwene atuletile tengela kwa kabeka Akayahudi na bandu banga Ayahudi kube lungolo lumwe. Ku mmele gwakwe mwene ngabomola lipamanda libalekania na kabeka kube angondwa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngaboya malagilo ga Akayahudi pamwe na maboulo gakwe. Kupala kuboke bandu banga Akayahudi na Akayahudi babe kilebe chimwe mukulondana na Kilisto nu kuleta tengela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ku kiu chakwe, Kilisto ngaboya ungondwa gwabe, kwa nchalaba gwakwe ngaibeka pamwe ikuta ibena ku mmele gumwe na kachikachana na Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kilisto ngaika ngatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone gwa tengela ku bandu boa, mangweto mabandu banga Akayahudi mammi kutaali na Nnoongo, nu uyo kwa Akayahudi abakiba papipi na Nnoongo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yene, kwa ndela jakwe, twenga tuboa tajendele Awawa kundela ju Uhuke jwa Chwapi ujwajo jumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuyene mangweto makagenije kabele, kabe mabandu ba panjaje. Mangweto nga makakola kilambo pamwe na bandu ba Nnoongo uyo mabandu bu lungolo lwa Nnoongo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nchengigwe panani pi kijemo chikibekigwe na achandundame na akalondoli ba Nnoongo, jwombe Kilisto Yesu mwene nga libwe likolongwa likijemo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Jwenio nga ojwalondana nyumba joa nu kujitenda jikole nu kube nyumba Chwapi ejipangigwe kwa Angwana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mukulondana Kilisto, mangweto pamwe na bange boa nchengigwe pamwe mmegange kitamo cha Nnoongo kwa ndela ja Uhuke jwakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Liengo lya Paulo ku bandu banga Akayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Magambu gwa genia, ne Paulo, nandabigwe magambu ga kummegele Kilisto Yesu na gambu gukuntangachi mangweto mabandu manga Akayahudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kweli nnyoininge kutenda Nnoongo, kwa gwambone gwakwe, ngangamuya liengo lende nilikamule kwa magambu ginu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nnoongo anhekulile ilebe yakwe eikiite. Andi pandumbwi kuandika kachoko, <verse number="4" style="v"/>namangweto andanchomangite malobe gango mammanya panamanya chili jenie ja Kilisto. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lolo bandu bamanyije chili jenie, nambu ngoe Nnoongo bapi kumanya achandundame na akalondoli bakwe bachwapi kwa ndela ju Uhuke. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chili jene nga jenje, ku ndela ja Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Yesu bandu banga Akayahudi bapatanga lipungu lyabe pamwe na Akayahudi kuboke mukindimba cha Nnoongo, angweto uyo ipagwa ya mmele ugwago, na angweto uyo babi mulilagano ulyale lyalagila Nnoongo ku ndela ja Kilisto Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nenga mekigwe kube napakachi ba Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Yesu Kilisto kwa gwambone gwannyika gwambi Nnoongo ku uwecho gwakwe nkolongwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nenga nachokochoko kupeta bandu ba Nnoongo boa, ata yene Nnoongo ambi gwambone gwakwe, kupala nantangachilange bandu banga Akayahudi kindimba cha Kilisto changapemeka, <verse number="9" style="v"/>kabe namulikilange bandu boa balole kupala kwa Nnoongo kukukiite putendigwa. Nnoongo ngaojwabi mpangani jwa ilebe yoa ngaiya chili jenje tango lolo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kupala ngoe kupete bandu boa abunhwamini Kilisto, Nnoongo mabatenda akakolongwa na akatawala kumbengu bamanye kinala chakwe pikibonekana kundela nduu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nnoongo atenda nhwalo gwenio tela na apapangite pangapela genia atenda ku ndela ja Yesu Kilisto Nngwana gwito. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ku kulondana na Kilisto na kunhwamini jwombe twenga tuotwi kunnyendele Nnoongo kongo tubi ndii panga mbwele. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuyene, nanyopanga makatopoka mwojoje magambu gu kupotekigwa kwango kwa magambu ginu, genia gabi kwa magambu gi kibumo chinu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mapalano ga Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwa magambu genia, nakilikitila majugwa Awawa, <verse number="15" style="v"/>jwabi kindumbutumbu chi ingolo yoa pannema na kumbengu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nannyopa Nnoongo, kibumo chakwe pikibi chukuomongwa, ampegange uwecho ku Uhuke jwakwe, nnimbange mumyojo jinu, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kilisto atame mumyojo jinu ku imani. Nanng'ongale mmegange ni mikega ni kijemo mulipalano lya Nnoongo, <verse number="18" style="v"/>kupala mabandu ba Nnoongo mmoa mmanyange mapalano ga Kilisto pagajoanika na mapana nu kutandamala, nu kola nu kunyolika. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Elo, milimanye lipalano likolongwa lya Kilisto elipeta malango goa, na mangweto mantwelela kindimba tegatega ku ndela yoa andi pabi Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nnoongo kwa makakala gakwe agakamu maengo nkati jito baotwile kutenda minhalo nduu muno kupeta agutujopa andaje kuwacha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kibe kibumo ku Nnoongo ku bandu boa gambu ga kukikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto na Kilisto Yesu mwene ku ingobu yoa, machoba goa pangapela! Unhyo.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulondana mumele gwa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ne nambi napungwa kwa kabegelela Angwana, nannyopanga ntamange tela andi pankemigwe na Nnoongo ntame. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mmaganga mabandu ba kunyenyepa, nuu na kuimbalila. Kuimbililana mmene makangweto kwa mapalano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkachanange kugoya kulondana kwinu okuletigwa nu Uhuke jwa Nnoongo kundela ja tengela ejijimmeka mme pamwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kubi na mmele gumwe gwa Kilisto nu Uhuke jwa Chwapi, jumwe, anda yene libi lihyobalelo limwe lyankemi Nnoongo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kubi na Angwana bamwe, imani jimwe nu ubaticho gumwe, <verse number="6" style="v"/>kubi na Nnoongo jumwe benia nga Awawa ba boa abunhwamini Kilisto, benia bakamwa maengo ku bandu boa, na babi umyojo ja bandu boa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kila mundu kati jito apatite hupo kuboka Nnoongo tela ni kipemo chatupi Kilisto. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Anda pagalenga Majandiko,</para>
  <para style="q">“Apajenda kumbengu kunani muno,</para>
  <para style="q">ngabalongalea pukongolou nnongi ja bandu andi bandu abapukaligwa mateka kungondo kulaya baotwile,</para>
  <para style="q">ngapanga hupo kubandu.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apilengigwa, “Ngajenda kunani,” ibi na mana nike? Mana gakwe yene, pukutumbula ngaika mpaka pae ja nnema. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jwenio ojwauluka pannema pano nga ojwajenda kunani ku mbengu yoa kupala autwelea nnema. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nga ojwabapa bandu hupo, bange ngababeka babe achandundame, bange akalondoli, bange babe akatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone, bange akachungi na akaboli ba bandu abunhwamini Kilisto. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Atenda yene kupala bapanganiki bandu ba Nnoongo gambu ga liengo likummele Kilisto kupala kuchenga mmele gwa Kilisto, <verse number="13" style="v"/>kuyene tuboa tuba pamwe kile chimwe ku imani nu kummanya Mwana jwa Nnoongo penia tuba tukomile nu kuika kulenganila andi pabi Kilisto mwene. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tubeje kabe andi ingota, nu kutoligwa na mawimbi nu kugoloigwa na kila aina ju upepo gwa maboulo agaletigwa na bandu buwangi kupala baoyange bange kukalamuka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Anda tulengaline ukweli ku mwojo gwa mapalano matujendekea komala mukila kilebe kunhwiki Kilisto ojwabi mutwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mu ulongoi gwakwe, ipagwa yoa ya mmele ikamulana pamwe, na mmele gwoa uhyobele ipagwa yakwe. Penia kila kipagwa kikamwa liengo lyakwe telatela, mmele gwoa kola nu kukichenga mumapalano.</para>
  <para style="s">Bwomi nhyono mu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwa liina lya Angwana, nankelebuya, makatamangaje kabele andi bandu bangummanya Nnoongo, ababi na mawacho gukutokamala, <verse number="18" style="v"/>bandu benia malango gabe gabi mulubendu. Babi kutaali na bwomi gwapanga Nnoongo magambu bummanyije Nnoongo magabu gukutokamala kwabe kukubi nkati jabe ni mitau jabe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bakwetije oni, ngibikibeka mungongola mbaja, angweto kutenda kila ile ya oni panga kotoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetumwe mikibolangitije yene kunhwalo gwa Kilisto. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ngi kipola kutenda ngannyoanga chwapi jakwe, makiba akinapunji bakwe ngammoligwa kweli ejibi mu Yesu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mmoligwe kuula majendo ginu mabaja ga kalakala andi mundu paula ngobo, kuula umundu gwinu gwa lolo ogualabigwe na tama yakwe yuwangi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwojo gwinu na malango ginu gagalambuke kube mayono. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nkwindange umundu nhyono ogupanganigwe ogubi andi Nnoongo, ogukilaya mukitamo cha kweli, nu kutenda gapala Nnoongo na chwapi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ku yene, muleke uwangi. Kila mundu apaligwa kunnenge nnyakwe kweli, magambu kila mundu kati jito ngi kipagwa cha mmele gwa Kilisto. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda nchimwangite, makajeketeje lilaka linu lyannyambuki kutenda malemwa, wala makatamaje ni lilaka lyoele tipi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Makampeje Mmaja lilanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ojwakiba akajiba, akajibaje kabele, nambu akamu maengo gambone kwa maboko gakwe, abe ni kilebe chu kumpe mundu nhwocho. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Malobe gangambone gakajoanikaje ngu katijinu, machoba goa malobe ginu gabe gambone nu gukujangata kabeka bange chwapi, kupala baalalange mwojo abannyoanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mukunhwechuyaje Uhuke jwa Chwapi jwa Nnoongo, gambu jwenio ngi kiingi cha Nnoongo ilaya kutenda lichoba lya Nnoogo elyaika kombola bandu bakwe mankomboligwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kubinia mwojo nu kuchimwa ni lilaka na manjega na matukano. Nnekange kila ubaja! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mmegange na mwojo gwa mbone na bina ukolelana kia, kila mundu annekekee nnyakwe andi Nnoongo apannekiinge mangweto kwa ndela ja Kilisto.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutama mulumuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuyene mannyigange Nnoongo, magambu mangweto ngi ingota yakwe yaipala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lipalano lilongalea bwomi gwinu andi Kilisto apatupaile, kwa magambu gito ngapanga bwomi gwakwe andi lilumbo lina kunungila na elilinhwalali Nnoongo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ku yene mangweto nga mabandu ba Nnoongo, ngongola, uwenje gwagwoa gola andaje tama mbaja yakajoanikaje kwinu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kabe malobe ga oni na gu upuchi andaje mitau, genia goa gapaligwije kwinu, malobe gu kunnumba Nnoongo nga agapaligwa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mmanyanga kipola kutenda nngongola jwajwoa andaje nchapu andaje tama mbaja, tama mbaja tela nu kugongale inyago, andaje mundu jwajwoa jwa aina jenie ajambulije chachoa mu kingwana cha Kilisto na cha Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Makajeketeje ukoloigwa na mundu kwa malobe gupuuchi, kwa magambu ga ilebe andi yenie Nnoongo mabahukumula bandu boa bangannyali. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mikikilondaje pamwe na angweto ku kilebe chochoa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kalakala mangweto makibanga pulubendu, nambu ngoe mangweto mmi mu lumuli kukulondana na Angwana. Kuyene ntamanga andi bandu ababi mulumuli, <verse number="9" style="v"/>magambu lumuli luleta kutenda ilebe yoa yambone, yapala Nnoongo nu kulonge kweli. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mikibolange kumanya agabapala Angwana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Makakamuje ganga mbone andi agatendigwa na bandu bumulubendu, nambu mabekange bandu benia pulumuli. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ilebe yabatendanga angweto kwa chili oni kulandulila. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nambu ilebe eitendigwa mu lumuli, kubonekana, <verse number="14" style="v"/>gambu lumuli lubeka kibonekane kila kilebe. Gambu Majandiko galenga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nnyimuke mwenga manng'ochile,</para>
  <para style="q">nhyoke kuboka kwa abawile,</para>
  <para style="q">Kilisto mammulikila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mmaganga maha pantamanga. Makatamangaje andi makajinga, nambu andi bina malango. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ntumianga gwicho kila lilanga lyampatanga magambu machoba ganga gambonije. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Makabegangaje makajinga, nambu mmanyange gabapala Angwana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nkoto kulobela divai gambu jenie jipakunhwalabia, nambu ntweleigwe Uhuke jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nnongelange malobe ga zabuli, minhambo ja kalumba ana Nnoongo ni minhambo ju kugongalela. Majembelange Angwana minhambo jakalumba mumyojo jinu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Malumbe ana Nnoongo Awawa machoba goa kwa magambu ga ilebe yoa, kwa liina lya Angwana bito Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="s">Akikege na akinalome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kila mundu annyali nnyakwe kwa magambu ga kunnyali Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Akikege bajali akangwanamundu anda kajali Angwana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Magambu analome nga mutwe gwa aanamundu andi Kilisto pabi mutwe gwa kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto mwene na jwenio Nkomboi ku bandu abunhwamini, yani mmele gwakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Andi yene kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto pabannyali Kilisto, uhyo na akikege bajali akangwanamundu mu ilebe yoa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Namakinalome, mapalange akaanabinu andi Kilisto apabapalanga bandu abunhwamini, ngakipanga bwomi gwakwe ube lilumbo kwa magambu gabe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Atenda yene kupala babeke chwapi bandu abunhwamini nnongi ja Nnoongo, kwa kajeleya ku lilobe lyakwe elibi andi mache. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Atela yene kupala akibeke kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto kibe china kualala muno, kikuta cha bandu chwapi changa malemwa, changa malelalela andaje mangwinyali andaje chochoa andi chenie. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Akinalome bapaligwa kapalanga akaanamundu andi mmele gwabe. Mundu jwabapala aanamundu akipala mwene. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Abije mundu jwajoa ojwauchimwa mmele gwakwe, nambu kupe chakulya nu kukwindia. Andi Kilisto apababegela bandu abunhwamini, <verse number="30" style="v"/>magambu twenga ngi ipagwa ya mmele gwakwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Kwa magambu genia, analome mabaleka awawamundu na amamamundu nu kulondana na aanamundu, na abele benia biba andi mundu jumwe.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ubi ukweli nkolongwa ogukiite gwa malobe ganga genia Nnoongo anhekulile ne, panole nenga kunhwalo gwa Kilisto ni kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwinu mangweto ipaligwa uyo, analome bapale aanamundu andi pibikipala bene na akege ipaligwa bajali angwanamundu.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ingota na achikibelei babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Makinangota magambu maamini Angwana majoe awabinu na amabinu, magambu chenie kile chambone. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mumajandiko ga Chwapi jibi amuli ejilenga, “Majoe awabinu na amamabinu,” jenie nga amuli jukutumbula ejikweti malagilo, <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Mme na bwomi na ntame kwa yaaka ndu pannema.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Machikibelei mikutumbuje nnomo ingota inu nambu milela nu kuikelebuya nu kuibola ndela yabapala Angwana.</para>
  <para style="s">Akabanda na akakolongwa babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mangweto makabanda, majali akangwana binu padunia pano kukupwelela nu kulendema, ntendanga yene kukuala mwojo andi kummegele Kilisto. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ntendanga yene ngati pabannoleke tuje kupala bammonange mambone, nambu mmegelelange kwa mwojo gwinu andi papala Nnoongo magambu mangwetumwe makapakachi ba Kilisto. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ntendanga maengo ginu andi makabanda kongo mmi lachi, andi mabegele Angwana ngiti gambu ga banduje. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nkombakela kutenda kila mundu ojwakamu gambone, abe mmanda andaje agabwa, mapokela hupo yakwe kuboka kwa Angwana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mangweto mammegaligwa, matendelanga uyo akabanda binu, nkoto kajogoyanga. Nkombakela kutenda mangweto mmi andi angweto, Angwana binu ubo bukumbengu, benia kubagwaje.</para>
  <para style="s">Ngondo yu uhuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kabe, nampalanga nnimbange mukulondana na Angwana na kukujangatigwa kwa makakala gabe makolongwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkwindange ilebe yukuputani ngondo eyampe Nnoongo kupala makajonjigwaje mumitambo ja Mmaja. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gambu kujomana kwito ngiti na banduje nambu tuputana na matyala gi michepela kunani kamaunde bina utawala na akangwana bina makakala abatawala dunia ju lubendu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Magambu gwa genia nkwindange ilebe yampe Nnoongo yukuputani ngondo. Kupala lichoba lyubaja pilipakuika penia mpakulimbanga kujingiligwa na akangondwa kuboka pu kuputana mpaka kujomola penia nhwoto kujema ndii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nnyemanga ndii, kweli jibe andi luunga mikibumo chinu, nu kutenda gapala Nnoongo andi kuibalaki kitibi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>chuna chu kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone gwa tengela ibe andi ilatu mumakongono ginu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kupeta genia, imani jiba machoba goa andi ngao mukuboku jinu, junhwotoye kujiimia michale jina mwoto ja Mmaja. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mpokelange ukoli andi kopia jinu ja choma, lilobe lya Nnoongo andi upanga ogwampe Uhuke jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nng'ongalelanga machoba goa, mannyopanga Nnoongo annyangate. Nng'ongalelange machoba goa andi Uhuke jwa Nnoongo pannongalea. Nkelukianga panga totakela makagongalela ku Nnoongo kwa magambu ga bandu ba Nnoongo boa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uyo unyopelanga nanenga kupala apanongela Nnoongo ambe chukulongela, nhoto kalenge bandu chili ju Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Yesu panga jogopa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nenga natangachi bu Nhwalo Gwambone gono iganukube ngoe mbi mukipungo. Nnyopange, kupala nakabe na bwogaje kutangacha andi pipaligwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupata abali kukujomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tukiko, nnongo gwito ojutumpala na mpakachi ojwaaminike mukulondana na Angwana, annengela ile yango yoa kupala mmanyange changamula. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nankinga kwinu annenge ilebe ito kupala annimbie mwojo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nannumbilanga makalongo tengela, lipalano na imani kuboka ku Nnoongo Awawa nu kuboka ku Nngwana Yesu Kilisto. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mmoa nannumbilanga gwambone gwa Nnoongo ube kwa bandu ababapala Angwana bito ana Yesu Kilisto kwa mapalano gangapela nannumbilanga gwambone gwa Nnoongo na mapalano ga machoba goa.</para>
</usx>
